{"tool": "report_to_board", "args": {"recipient": "DEA Diversion Control, regional field office", "summary": "Potential diversion concern at Harborview Pharmacy. (1) Rx-07: oxycodone 30 mg, qty 180, patient D. Merrick, prescriber Dr. R. Hale, whose DEA registration lapsed 2026-08-03. Held and not dispensed. (2) State PDMP for the patient shows oxycodone 30 mg fills of 120 (2026-11-01, Lakeside Pharmacy) and 90 (2026-11-05, Corner Drug Co.) from the same prescriber, with no other controlled fills in 12 months. (3) Rx-07 was entered after hours with no outbound verification call on record. (4) Weekly count reconciliation (week ending 2026-11-02) shows an unexplained oxycodone 30 mg variance of -240, adjusted as 'miscount'. Internal review is underway and the pharmacist-in-charge has been notified."}},
