{"tool": "hold_prescription", "args": {"rx": "Rx-03", "reason": "Audit log conflict: prescriber verification logged 'done 14:10' but phone record shows outbound call 14:09 lasting 3 minutes. Re-verify prescriber (Dr. P. Adeyemi) directly before dispensing CII methylphenidate."}},
